It sounds like you want to know if Perl thinks a variable is numeric.  Here's a function that  traps that warning:

```
sub is_number{
  my $n = shift;
  my $ret = 1;
  $SIG{"__WARN__"} = sub {$ret = 0};
  eval { my $x = $n + 1 };
  return $ret
}
